    {"id":"job-work","type":"confusable","title":{"en":"job or work","fi":"job vai work"},"explanation":{"en":"A job is countable: a job, two jobs, a new job. Work is uncountable (a lot of work) and is also the place you go: I go to work.","fi":"Suomen työ on englanniksi kaksi sanaa. *Job* on laskettava: *a job*, *two jobs*, *a new job* (työpaikka). *Work* on ainesana (*a lot of work*, työtä) ja myös paikka, jonne mennään: *I go to work*."},"level":1,"words":[{"text":"job","meaning":{"fi":"työpaikka, työtehtävä"}},{"text":"work","meaning":{"fi":"työ, työnteko; tehdä työtä"}}],"features":["confusable","uncountable","article"]},
