    {"id":"during-while","type":"confusable","title":{"en":"during or while","fi":"during vai while"},"explanation":{"en":"During comes before a noun: during the movie, during the night. While comes before a whole sentence: while I was watching the movie.","fi":"Molemmat tarkoittavat aikana. *During* tulee substantiivin eteen: *during the movie* (elokuvan aikana). *While* tulee kokonaisen lauseen eteen: *while I was watching the movie* (kun katsoin elokuvaa)."},"level":2,"words":[{"text":"during","meaning":{"fi":"aikana (+ substantiivi)"}},{"text":"while","meaning":{"fi":"sillä aikaa kun, kun (+ lause)"}}],"features":["confusable","word-order"]},
