    {"id":"advice-advise","type":"confusable","title":{"en":"advice or advise","fi":"advice vai advise"},"explanation":{"en":"Advice (with a c and an s sound) is the noun, and it is uncountable: some advice, a piece of advice, never an advice. Advise (with an s and a z sound) is the verb: I'd advise you to go.","fi":"*Advice* on substantiivi neuvo ja se on ainesana: *some advice*, *a piece of advice*, ei koskaan *an advice*. Se äännetään *s*-äänteellä. *Advise* on verbi neuvoa, ja se äännetään *z*-äänteellä: *I'd advise you to go*."},"level":2,"words":[{"text":"advice","meaning":{"fi":"neuvo, neuvoja (substantiivi)"}},{"text":"advise","meaning":{"fi":"neuvoa (verbi)"}}],"features":["confusable","uncountable","z-sound"]},
